@* Upstream's own trio: two people, three turns, and the avatar on the side each of them speaks
   from — flex-row-reverse on an end-aligned message does that with no second class string. The
   avatar is aria-hidden, because the author's name is in the header right beside it, and
   announcing "MR, Marta Ruiz" on every message is announcing it twice. *@
<div class="flex w-full max-w-sm flex-col gap-6">
    <Message>
        <MessageAvatar><Avatar><AvatarFallback>MR</AvatarFallback></Avatar></MessageAvatar>
        <MessageContent>
            <Bubble Variant="muted">
                <BubbleContent>The build failed during dependency installation.</BubbleContent>
            </Bubble>
        </MessageContent>
    </Message>

    <Message Align="end">
        <MessageAvatar><Avatar><AvatarFallback>BT</AvatarFallback></Avatar></MessageAvatar>
        <MessageContent>
            <Bubble><BubbleContent>Can you share the exact error?</BubbleContent></Bubble>
        </MessageContent>
    </Message>

    <Message>
        <MessageAvatar><Avatar><AvatarFallback>MR</AvatarFallback></Avatar></MessageAvatar>
        <MessageContent>
            <Bubble Variant="muted">
                <BubbleContent>ENOENT: no such file or directory, open 'package-lock.json'.</BubbleContent>
            </Bubble>
        </MessageContent>
    </Message>
</div>
